msgctxt "#30074"
msgid "Mask out (vertically) the potentially random glitchy video output that would have been hidden by the bezel around the edge of a standard-definition television screen."
msgstr "Masquer (verticalement) la sortie vidéo potentiellement buggée et aléatoire qui aurait été cachée par le biseau autour du bord d'un écran de télévision définition standard."

msgctxt "#30075"
msgid "Mask out (horizontally) the potentially random glitchy video output that would have been hidden by the bezel around the edge of a standard-definition television screen."
